.TH MU2E-SHIFT-SCHEDULER 1 "2026-08-31" "Mu2e Shift Scheduler v1.0.0" "Mu2e Shift Scheduler"
.SH NAME
mu2e-shift-scheduler \- command-line interface to the Mu2e shift scheduler
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mu2e-shift-scheduler
.I solve
\fB\-\-shifts\fR \fICSV\fR \fB\-\-people\fR \fICSV\fR
[\fB\-\-config\fR \fIYAML\fR] [\fB\-\-target\fR \fIN\fR] [\fB\-\-min\fR \fIN\fR]
[\fB\-\-max\fR \fIN\fR] [\fB\-\-alpha\fR \fIF\fR] [\fB\-\-out\fR \fIFILE\fR]
.br
.B mu2e-shift-scheduler
.I serve
[\fB\-\-host\fR \fIHOST\fR] [\fB\-\-port\fR \fIPORT\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Console entry point installed by the package (\fIpyproject.toml\fR); it is
equivalent to running
.IR "python cli.py" .
The
.I solve
subcommand runs the two-pass ILP solver over a shifts CSV and a people CSV and
writes assignments; the
.I serve
subcommand starts the web interface. Run each subcommand with
.B \-\-help
for the full option list.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR start-mu2e-shift-scheduler (1),
.BR create-shift-blocks (1)
